  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday night through Friday)\nIssued at 101 AM EDT Sat Aug 15 2026\n\nSaharan dust will continue to linger through the early part of next \nweek, which will continue to keep PoPs well below average through at \nleast Wednesday. As dust concentrations decrease across the area \nlate in the week, low level moisture is expected to increase and \nPoPs will rebound to closer to seasonal norms. \n\nHeat will continue to be a major story next week, with above average \ntemps expected to continue. High temps each day will range from the \nlow to mid 90s across the metro, to upper 90s over interior South \nFL. Peat heat indices each day will approach or exceed advisory \ncriteria.",
